1
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:16,530
What the hell is that?!
誰在鬼叫？

2
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,420
What the hell is that? Is that you?
誰在鬼叫？是你嗎？

3
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:32,590
-You're really not a morning person. -Just back off!
你清晨的火氣還真大 滾遠一點

4
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,100
Get up! Get up! Get up!
起來！…

5
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,600
What is that noise?
那是什麼聲音？

6
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:46,200
You!
是你的敲門聲！

7
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,700
It's the chick.
是小雞啦

8
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:53,140
She's going through some changes.
它正歷經過度時期

9
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,720
What kind of changes?
什麼過度時期？

10
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,980
The vet seems to think...
獸醫認為…

11
00:00:58,190 --> 00:01:00,480
...she's becoming a rooster.
咱們的小母雞要長大成公雞了

12
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,220
We're getting a second opinion.
我們打算再問問別的獸醫

13
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,190
The One With the Embryos
本集播出：公寓大搬風

00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,190
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:58,740
Why are you shopping at 8 in the morning?
你幹嘛清晨八點去血拼？

15
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:00,470
I've been up since 6...
我六點鐘就起床了

16
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:03,310
...thanks to somebody's dumb-ass rooster.
都是被某人的笨公雞害的

17
00:02:04,190 --> 00:02:08,280
You should get rid of those animals. They shouldn't be in an apartment.
你們應該把它們處理掉 它們不應該窩在公寓裡

18
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:11,890
Especially not with these knives and cookbooks around.
是啊，特別是這裡 又有那麼多刀和食譜

19
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:16,930
I'm going to the doctor and see if I'm ready...
我要去看婦產科醫生

20
00:02:17,130 --> 00:02:21,430
...to have Frank and Alice's embryo transferred into my uterus.
看看能不能把法蘭克和艾莉絲的胚胎 移植到我的子宮裡去

23
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,430
How will they know?
他們怎麼知道你準備好了沒？

24
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:27,970
They'll just see if my endometrial layer is thick.
他們要看看我的子宮內膜 是不是已經增厚了

25
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:30,740
I can check that for you.
我幫你看就好了

27
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:32,950
Okay,think "thick."
各位，幫我的子宮內膜加油吧

28
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,940
Good luck!
祝你好運

29
00:02:36,450 --> 00:02:37,440
Wish me luck.
快祝我幸運

30
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,240
Good luck.
祝你好運

31
00:02:39,450 --> 00:02:42,750
-I'm still right. -That is so not true.
我說得沒錯啦 鬼扯

32
00:02:42,990 --> 00:02:44,080
What?

33
00:02:44,330 --> 00:02:46,690
I know it's her laundry day...
她不爽是因為我知道 她今天要洗衣服

34
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:50,560
...and that means she's wearing her old-lady underpants.
所以現在穿的是老奶奶大內褲

35
00:02:51,930 --> 00:02:53,920
I can check that for you.
要不要我檢查一下？

36
00:02:55,140 --> 00:02:57,540
You two think you know me and Rachel...
你們憑什麼認為 比瑞秋和我...

37
00:02:57,770 --> 00:02:59,470
...better than we know you.
...更瞭解我們？

38
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:02,470
Well,we do.
本來就是

39
00:03:03,010 --> 00:03:05,950
You can only eat Tic Tacs in even numbers.
你吃薄荷糖時一定要吃偶數

40
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:08,110
What's that about?
你有什麼毛病啊？

41
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:11,810
And you! Ross,if you check Rachel's bag...
而你嘛… 羅斯，你去搜搜瑞秋的購物袋

43
00:03:12,050 --> 00:03:14,890
...you'll find a half-eaten box of cookies in there.
裡面一定有一盒 吃了一半的餅乾

44
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:20,650
You're good.
高明

45
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,760
These are not.
這包餅乾就不怎麼高明了

46
00:03:24,270 --> 00:03:27,720
I'm so not impressed. Everybody snacks when they shop.
有什麼了不起 哪有人買東西時不吃零嘴？

47
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:30,930
Ross,how many items left in that bag?
是嗎？羅斯，購物袋裡 還有幾樣東西？

48
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:32,130
Five.
五樣

49
00:03:32,510 --> 00:03:37,100
Okay,10 bucks says we can name every item in that bag.
賭十塊，我們能說出 那五樣東西是什麼

50
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:40,400
-How many guesses? -Six.
你們能猜幾次？ 六次

51
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:42,210
Challenge extended.
男生隊下戰書

52
00:03:44,090 --> 00:03:47,710
-Deal! -Challenge accepted.
賭就賭 女生隊接受挑戰

53
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:50,550
All right,we'll start with...
第一樣是…

54
00:03:51,390 --> 00:03:52,380
...apples.
...蘋果

55
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:55,650
We'll be starting with apples.
我們就從蘋果開始

56
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:59,700
Stop that now.
拜託你住嘴

57
00:04:01,670 --> 00:04:02,660
Yes.
有蘋果

58
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:05,200
Okay. Tortilla chips.
玉米片

59
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,930
-Yogurt. -Diet soda.
優格 健怡汽水

60
00:04:07,647 --> 00:04:09,774
對…

61
00:04:11,650 --> 00:04:14,980
-Orange juice. -There's no orange juice! We win!
柳橙汁 我沒買柳橙汁，我們贏了！

63
00:04:15,550 --> 00:04:17,310
They have another guess.
等等，他們還能再猜一次

64
00:04:18,350 --> 00:04:20,150
Well,we won that one.
但是那題我們贏了

65
00:04:21,290 --> 00:04:23,420
Okay. The last thing is
最後一樣東西是…

66
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:30,290
Not for another two weeks.
不是…還要等兩周

67
00:04:33,530 --> 00:04:34,560
I got it.
我知道了

68
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:35,930
Scotch...
膠…

69
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,130
...tape.
帶

70
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:45,240
How did you know she would buy Scotch tape?
你怎麼知道她會買膠帶？

71
00:04:45,450 --> 00:04:48,380
We used up theirs last night making scary faces.
我們昨晚玩扮鬼臉時 把她們的膠帶用光了

72
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:51,210
Oh,man!
討厭

73
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:54,050
All right! Ten bucks. Fork it over.
十塊錢，願賭服輸

74
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:57,260
Cough it up. Pay the piper.
甘願點

75
00:04:58,030 --> 00:04:59,150
Give me it!
拿錢來

76
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:03,060
You don't know us better. I want a rematch.
這沒什麼了不起 我要再比一次

77
00:05:03,330 --> 00:05:06,560
And no stupid grocery questions. Real,personal questions.
猜雜貨沒挑戰性 這次要問切身問題

78
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:09,330
And the winner gets $100.
賭一百塊

79
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:13,360
-Serious? -Are you scared?
你當真？ 怕了？

81
00:05:14,780 --> 00:05:15,900
No.
才怪

82
00:05:17,550 --> 00:05:19,410
Who makes up the questions?
誰出考題？

83
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,840
Ross will do it.
羅斯

84
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:23,780
Sure,Ross will do it.
是啊，找羅斯

85
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:28,080
It's not like he has a job or a child or a life of his own.
反正他沒工作，沒兒子 生活又無聊

86
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:31,620
-Fine. We'll ask Phoebe. -No,I want to play.
好嘛，那找菲比好了 不要，人家想玩嘛

88
00:05:37,130 --> 00:05:40,070
Looks like your uterus is ready for implantation.
你的子宮可以做胚胎移植了

89
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:43,800
I knew it! I felt really thick this morning.
我就知道 我今天早上就覺得厚厚的

90
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:48,230
Okay,so what's now? Go get the eggs. Put them in there.
現在怎麼辦？ 快去把卵子放進去

91
00:05:48,510 --> 00:05:51,810
It'll take a little while to prepare the embryos.
我要花點時間準備那些胚胎

92
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:56,020
-Embryos? As in more than one? -Five,actually.
那些胚胎？不只一個？ 事實上，一共有五個

93
00:05:56,350 --> 00:05:58,340
Where am I giving birth...
五個？

95
00:05:58,550 --> 00:06:01,350
...in a hospital or a big box under the stairs?
你把我當母豬啊？

96
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:06,290
Doing five gives you a 25% chance that at least one will attach.
植入五個胚胎 表示著床機率大概是25%

97
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,390
That's it? 25%?
25%？這麼少？

98
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:12,400
That means that it's,like, 75% chance of no baby at all?
這表示我生不出小孩的機率 是75%？

99
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,800
I was thinking, what are the odds...
那如果兩百個胚胎進去 

100
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:17,600
...if you stuff 200 of them in there?
機率會不會高一點？

101
00:06:19,210 --> 00:06:20,500
Sweetie,now...
親愛的，

102
00:06:20,780 --> 00:06:23,640
...she's a woman, not a gumball machine.
她是個女人 不是賣泡泡糖的機器

103
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:31,220
Don't worry. I'll do this as many times as it takes to get it right.
別擔心 我會一直做到成功為止

104
00:06:31,490 --> 00:06:34,980
The thing is,we kind of only have one shot.
但是我們只有一次機會

105
00:06:35,790 --> 00:06:39,230
It costs $16,000 each time you do this.
做一次移植要花一萬六千塊

106
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:42,050
Sixteen thousand dollars?!
一萬六千塊？ 

107
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:46,220
Well,it's 20 in California.
我們已經比加州便宜了

108
00:06:47,170 --> 00:06:51,540
We're kind of using all the money we have to do it this one time.
我們為了這一次 已經花光所有的積蓄

110
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:57,700
Okay,that's a lot of pressure on me and my uterus.
天啊，這讓我和我的子宮 壓力超大

111
00:06:59,310 --> 00:07:04,180
Maybe there's something I can do to make sure I get pregnant.
也許我能做些什麼事 來提高懷孕的機率

112
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:05,750
No,I'm sorry.
沒有

113
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:08,610
Wow,you guys really don't know anything.
你們真是啥都不懂

114
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:14,860
Why don't you get drunk? It worked for a bunch of girls in my high school.
那她喝個爛醉如何？ 我很多高中同學 都是這樣搞大肚子的

116
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:26,200
-So how's the test coming? -Hey,you're touching the game board.
問題準備得如何？ 別亂動

118
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:28,600
Sorry.
抱歉啦

119
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:30,900
You freak.
怪胎

121
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:36,770
Do you realize that any minute now...
你們知道菲比現在 

122
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:38,470
...Phoebe could be pregnant?
隨時可能會懷孕嗎？

123
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:40,780
I know,I know.
我知道…

124
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:43,890
It's such a huge, life-altering thing.
這件事真是非同小可 是啊

125
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,620
The test is ready.
考題準備好了

126
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,490
Okay. Each team will answer 10 questions.
每一隊都要回答十個問題 

127
00:07:54,770 --> 00:07:58,600
The first team to answer the most questions wins.
答對最多的那一隊就贏

128
00:07:58,810 --> 00:08:02,300
The categories are "Fears and Pet Peeves"...
考題項目如下… 「恐懼和怪癖」

129
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:04,240
..."Ancient History"...
「陳年往事」

130
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,000
..."Literature"...
「文學」

131
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:08,580
...and "It's all Relative."
和「日常瑣事」

132
00:08:10,250 --> 00:08:11,410
Now...

133
00:08:11,690 --> 00:08:15,180
...the coin toss, to see who goes first.
我們丟硬幣來決定哪一隊先攻

134
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:23,800
Okay.

135
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:26,260
Somebody call it this time.
拜託你們先猜哪一面

136
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:28,930
Tails!
字

137
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:30,800
It's heads.
是人頭

138
00:08:32,670 --> 00:08:35,110
Gentlemen,pick your category.
男生隊，請挑項目

139
00:08:35,380 --> 00:08:37,310
"Fears and Pet Peeves."
「恐懼和怪癖」

140
00:08:38,210 --> 00:08:41,340
"What is Monica's biggest pet peeve?"
摩妮卡最受不了什麼？

141
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:43,480
-Animals dressed as humans. -Correct.
動物穿衣服 答對了

142
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:48,580
-Ladies? -Same category.
女生隊？ 同一個項目

143
00:08:50,530 --> 00:08:55,020
"According to Chandler,what phenomenon scares the bejesus out of him?"
錢德最怕什麼東西？

144
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,230
Michael Flatley,Lord of the Dance!
踢踏舞之王麥克費特利

145
00:09:00,740 --> 00:09:02,760
That is correct.
答對了

146
00:09:04,370 --> 00:09:06,740
The lrish jig guy?
那個跳舞的愛爾蘭人？

147
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:11,070
His legs flail about as if independent from his body!
他那雙腳跳舞時 好像跟身體分離了一樣

148
00:09:12,650 --> 00:09:14,050
Gentlemen,your pick.
男生隊，輪到你們了

149
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:15,610
"It's all Relative."
「日常瑣事」

150
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:19,110
"Monica and I had a grandmother who died.
摩妮卡和我的祖母過世時 

151
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:21,450
You both went to her funeral.
兩位都參加了她的葬禮

152
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:24,050
Name that grandmother."
我們祖母叫什麼名字？

153
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:29,660
-Nana? -She has a real name.
姥姥？ 她有個真正的名字吧

155
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:31,390
Althea!
艾席雅

156
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,930
-What? -I took a shot!
什麼？ 試試看嘛

157
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:34,120
With Althea?
那幹嘛猜艾席雅？ 

158
00:09:34,370 --> 00:09:36,840
-Althea is correct. -Nice shooting!
答對了 猜得好

159
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,740
"Literature."
「文學」

160
00:09:42,410 --> 00:09:47,040
"Every week the TV Guide comes to Chandler and Joey's apartment.
喬伊和錢德 每週都會收到「電視週刊」

161
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:50,340
What name appears on the address label?"
請問收件人的姓名為何？

162
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:53,520
Chandler gets it! It's Chandler Bing!
錢德訂的，當然是錢德賓羅

163
00:09:54,190 --> 00:09:58,350
I'm afraid the TV Guide comes to "Chanandler Bong."
不是啦 「電視週刊」收件人的姓名 是「錢尼德勒邦」

165
00:10:01,430 --> 00:10:02,900
I knew that!
我知道正確答案

166
00:10:03,100 --> 00:10:05,070
Rachel,use your head!
瑞秋，用用腦子行不行？

167
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,230
Actually,it's Ms. Chanandler Bong.
事實上 應該是「錢尼德勒邦小姐」

168
00:10:17,010 --> 00:10:19,170
Hello,teeny embryos.
嗨，各位小胚胎

169
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:22,940
I'm Phoebe Buffay. Hi!
我是菲比

170
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:28,560
I'm hoping to be your uterus for the next nine months.
我的子宮 就是各位未來九個月的家

171
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,720
We're doing this for Frank and Alice...
我們這麼做 都是為了法蘭克和艾莉絲

172
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:34,390
...who you know. You've been there.
你們跟他們應該很熟

173
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,230
They want you so much.
他們真的很希望能有個小寶寶

174
00:10:39,470 --> 00:10:43,130
So when you guys get in there, really grab on.
你們進去之後好好抓緊

175
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:47,040
And I promise that I'll keep you safe and warm...
我保證會讓你們 住得又舒服又安全

176
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:50,440
...until you're ready to have them take you home.
直到你們準備好 讓他們帶你們回家為止

177
00:10:55,650 --> 00:10:59,250
Next time you see me, if I'm screaming,don't worry.
咱們下次見面時 我應該會雞貓子喊叫

178
00:10:59,490 --> 00:11:01,750
That's what's supposed to happen.
請別擔心，這是很正常的

179
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,880
Ready?
準備好了嗎？

180
00:11:06,290 --> 00:11:07,560
Good luck!
祝好運

181
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:13,060
The score is nine to eight in favor of the guys.
目前比數是九比八 男生隊領先

182
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:16,930
Ladies,if you miss this, the game is theirs. Pick a category.
女生隊若答錯這題 男生隊就贏了 選一個項目吧

183
00:11:17,140 --> 00:11:18,800
"It's all Relative"!
「日常瑣事」

185
00:11:20,610 --> 00:11:23,740
-You don't have to shout everything. -I'm sorry!
犯不著拉直嗓子吼 對不起！

186
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:30,310
"What is the name of Chandler's father's...
錢德父親在賭城的男子歌舞秀 

187
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:33,490
...Las Vegas all-male burlesque?"
叫做什麼名字？

188
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:36,750
Viva Las Gaygas!
「同志萬歲」

189
00:11:38,830 --> 00:11:40,920
Unfortunately,that is correct.
很不幸的…你答對了

190
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:45,490
All right. We have a tie.
目前雙方平手

191
00:11:45,700 --> 00:11:49,690
Luckily,I've prepared for such an event.
不過我早有準備了

192
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:52,830
The lightning round!
搶答

193
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:59,740
Thirty seconds. All the questions you can answer.
雙方各有30秒搶答

194
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:01,850
You guys are dead!
你們輸定了

195
00:12:02,050 --> 00:12:04,480
I am so good at lightning rounds!
我超會搶答

196
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:08,880
I majored in lightning rounds, all right?
我大學是主修搶答的

197
00:12:09,090 --> 00:12:10,350
We'll destroy you.
你們才輸定了

198
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,550
Want to bet?
敢不敢賭？

199
00:12:12,090 --> 00:12:15,390
I'm so confused as to what we've been doing so far.
怪了，我們這不正是在賭嗎？

200
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:19,890
How about we play for more money? Say 150?
把賭注提高到… 150塊如何？

201
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:23,000
One hundred and fifty dollars.
150塊

202
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:26,340
Say 200?
200塊如何？

203
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:28,910
Two hundred dollars!
200塊

204
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:30,570
You're doing it again.
你又來了

205
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:32,510
Excuse me.
不好意思

206
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:35,840
-I don't want to lose $200. -We won't.
我不想輸200塊 我們不會輸的

207
00:12:36,050 --> 00:12:38,450
Three hundred?
300塊如何？ 摩妮卡

208
00:12:39,190 --> 00:12:40,550
I'm spicing it up!
我只是想讓比賽更香辣有勁

209
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:44,120
So play for some pepper! Stop spending my money.
賭辣椒行不行？ 別再亂花我的錢了

210
00:12:45,630 --> 00:12:46,620
I got it!
我有了

211
00:12:46,930 --> 00:12:50,390
If we win,they have to get rid of the rooster.
我們贏的話 他們就得處理掉那只公雞

212
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,400
That's interesting!
有意思

213
00:12:52,730 --> 00:12:55,630
-No way! That rooster's family. -The duck too!
不行，公雞和我們是一家人 還有那只鴨

214
00:12:55,870 --> 00:12:57,860
The duck doesn't make noise!
幹嘛扯上那只鴨？它又不亂叫

216
00:12:58,070 --> 00:13:00,340
He gets the other one all riled up!
那隻雞被它搞得心浮氣躁

217
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:03,500
-We are not -All right,hold on!
聽著，我們絕不… 等等

218
00:13:05,450 --> 00:13:06,670
If you win...
你們贏的話 

219
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,710
...we give up the bird.
我們就處理掉那只公雞

220
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:13,290
But if we win...
我們贏的話… 

221
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:16,250
...we get your apartment.
就把你們的公寓讓給我們

222
00:13:19,190 --> 00:13:22,460
-Deal! -What?
成交 什麼？

223
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:27,730
That's crazy. There's no way we are betting the apartment.
這太扯了，我絕不拿公寓來賭

224
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:35,840
All right,I'm in. Because either he goes,or I'm buying a coyote.
好，我賭了！ 那隻雞不走我就要買隻狼

226
00:13:47,860 --> 00:13:50,590
Betting the apartment? I don't know about this.
拿公寓來賭好像不太穩當

227
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:54,390
I have not missed one question the whole game. I own this game!
瑞秋，我從頭到尾 一題都沒答錯 我會贏的！

228
00:13:54,530 --> 00:13:58,020
-Look at my hand. -You have the answers written there?
看我的手 你手上有寫小抄嗎？

231
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:02,500
No. Steady as a rock. Now,are you with me?
不是啦，我的手穩得很 你還不放心嗎？

232
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,360
All right,let's do it!
咱們上陣吧 這樣才對

233
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:09,500
All right. Gentlemen,you're up first.
男生隊先攻

234
00:14:09,810 --> 00:14:12,370
You have 30 seconds.
限時搶答30秒

235
00:14:13,350 --> 00:14:15,540
The lightning round begins
搶答階段要開始了…

236
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,220
Stop it!
不准跳

237
00:14:19,190 --> 00:14:22,280
"Monica's nickname when she was a hockey goalie?"
摩妮卡當曲棍球隊 守門員的外號為何？

238
00:14:22,490 --> 00:14:24,290
-Big Fat Goalie. -Correct!
胖球門 正確

239
00:14:26,990 --> 00:14:29,390
"Rachel claims it's her favorite movie."
瑞秋宣稱 她最喜歡的電影為何？

240
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:30,990
Dangerous Liaisons.
「危險關係」

241
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,930
-"Her actual favorite is...?" -Weekend at Bernie's.
她真正喜歡的電影是哪一部？ 「玩死老弟」

243
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:40,340
"In what part of her body did Monica get a pencil stuck at age 14?"
摩妮卡14歲時 身上哪個部位卡了一枝鉛筆？

244
00:14:44,310 --> 00:14:45,570
No!
惡…

245
00:14:48,020 --> 00:14:49,070
Her ear!
是她的耳朵

246
00:14:52,350 --> 00:14:56,450
"Monica categorizes her towels. How many categories are there?"
摩妮卡的毛巾都分門別類 一共分為幾類？

247
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:57,880
-Everyday use. -Fancy.
日常用毛巾 高級毛巾

248
00:14:58,090 --> 00:14:59,530
-Guest. -Fancy guest.
客用毛巾 高級客用毛巾

249
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:02,730
-Two seconds. -Eleven?
還剩兩秒鐘 11類？

251
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:05,020
Unbelievable! Eleven is correct!
不可思議，答對了

253
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:10,160
All right.
太好了…

254
00:15:10,370 --> 00:15:12,640
That's four for the guys. Ladies,you're up!
男生隊答對四題 現在輪女生隊搶答

255
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,470
Thirty seconds on the clock.
限時搶答30秒 

256
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:23,280
Five correct questions wins the game.
答對五題你們就贏了

257
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:27,090
The lightning round begins now. "Joey's favorite food?"
搶答開始 喬伊最喜歡的食物為何？

258
00:15:27,290 --> 00:15:28,720
-Sandwiches! -Correct.
三明治 正確

259
00:15:28,990 --> 00:15:31,390
"Chandler was how old when he first touched a girl's breast?"
錢德第一次 摸女生胸部是幾歲？

260
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,960
-14? -No,19.
14歲？ 不，19

261
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,290
Thanks,man.
謝了，老哥

262
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:37,400
"Joey had an imaginary childhood friend.
喬伊小時有個幻想中的朋友

263
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:39,060
-His name was...?" -Maurice!
他的名字叫… 莫瑞斯

264
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:42,330
-"His profession was...?" -Space cowboy!
正確，他的職業是… 太空牛仔

266
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:45,730
"What is Chandler Bing's job?"
錢德賓的工作為何？

267
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:52,210
It has something to do with numbers!
跟數字有關

268
00:15:52,410 --> 00:15:54,570
-And processing! -He carries a briefcase.
還有處理 他上班帶公事包

269
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:57,180
Ten seconds. You need this or you lose.
剩10秒鐘，答錯就輸了

270
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:59,580
Something to do with transponding.
跟答詢有關

271
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:02,220
He's a transponster!
他是答詢員

272
00:16:04,430 --> 00:16:06,260
That's not even a word!
哪有這種字？

273
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:10,420
I can get this! I can get this!
我知道…

274
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:17,365
不… 爽…

275
00:16:27,210 --> 00:16:30,740
-I call Monica's room. -You can't just call Monica's room.
我要摩妮卡的房間 這哪是你說要就要的

277
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,990
Sure I can. Standard shotgun rules.
哪不是，先下手為強

278
00:16:33,190 --> 00:16:35,660
I'm in sight of the room and I called it.
誰叫你不先要

279
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:39,190
Damn!
（可惡）

280
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:42,490
I feel like I'm coming down with something.
我好像要生病了

281
00:16:43,930 --> 00:16:46,870
Guess the color of my tonsils. I bet the apartment!
要不要猜猜我的扁桃腺 是什麼顏色？ 用公寓來賭

282
00:16:47,100 --> 00:16:49,660
I would never bet this place. It's too nice.
我才不會拿 這麼棒的公寓來賭呢

284
00:16:53,310 --> 00:16:54,430
Are they in there?
菲比，你肚子裡有東西了嗎？

285
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,440
Yeah,I'm implanted.
對，胚胎放進去了

286
00:16:56,940 --> 00:16:59,710
-How do you feel? -Well,freaked.
你覺得怎麼樣？ 擔心死了

288
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:04,010
It turns out the odds are really sucky.
成功的機率不高

289
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:06,880
And this is Frank and Alice's only shot.
但法蘭克和艾莉絲 只有這次機會

290
00:17:07,190 --> 00:17:10,620
They are literally putting all their eggs in my basket.
他們把所有的蛋 都放在我的籃子裡

291
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,890
But I bet it works.
我相信你一定會成功

292
00:17:14,190 --> 00:17:16,290
Really? How much?
是嗎？你要賭多少？

293
00:17:18,230 --> 00:17:20,890
I'm going to take a pregnancy test now.
我現在就去驗孕

294
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:23,040
Wow! You can tell this soon?
這麼快？

295
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:25,500
The doctor says it takes a few days.
醫生說要等兩天

296
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:29,830
But my body's always been a little faster than Western medicine.
但是我的身體 一向比西方醫學快一點

297
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:37,080
I can't believe you guys think you're moving in here.
天啊 你們真以為能搬進來？

299
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:39,480
Well,believe it,baby!
面對現實吧，寶貝

300
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:43,650
-Well,I'm not moving. -What?
我不走 什麼？

302
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:48,250
No. It was a stupid bet. We were just playing a game.
那不過是場愚蠢的賭局 玩玩罷了

303
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:50,590
You can't ignore the bet. It's a bet!
賭就賭了，哪能不算

304
00:17:50,830 --> 00:17:53,660
Bet on a bet and if you lose,you lose the bet.
賭輸就是輸了

305
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:55,990
We have to move.
我們非搬不可

306
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:59,570
We would have made them get rid of the birds.
若我們贏了 也會逼他們把雞鴨處理掉

307
00:18:00,345 --> 00:18:02,006
才怪

308
00:18:03,610 --> 00:18:07,670
I hate this as much as you, but if it makes you feel better...
我也不想這樣 但說句安慰你的話…

309
00:18:07,950 --> 00:18:10,140
...this is all your fault.
這全都是你的錯

310
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,310
What?
什麼？

311
00:18:12,490 --> 00:18:16,250
Chanandler Bong! We steal that TV Guide every week!
我們每週都偷他們的電視週刊 你怎麼會不知道收件人是誰？

312
00:18:16,460 --> 00:18:18,480
I knew it!
我就知道

313
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:21,690
I don't care. I'm not going anywhere.
我不管，我不走

314
00:18:21,930 --> 00:18:24,120
Cool! Girl roommate.
酷啊，跟女生做室友

315
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:28,790
Well?
怎麼樣？

316
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,630
Nope,not knocked up yet.
我的肚子還沒被搞大

317
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:34,130
It's only been a couple hours.
才過兩個小時耶，耐心點

318
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:38,170
Meanwhile,I'll do whatever I can to help this.
我也要為這件事盡一份力

319
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:41,840
I'm just going to,you know, lie in your chair,okay?
讓我躺在你們的椅子上

320
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:46,820
Good. I'm going to let gravity do its job.
讓地心引力發揮作用

321
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:49,750
I won't get in the way.
我不會礙事的

322
00:18:49,890 --> 00:18:54,160
It'll be just like that time I tried to count all the bumps on your ceiling.
就像我那次躺在這裡 數天花板上的蟲子一樣

323
00:18:55,330 --> 00:19:00,490
You know,Pheebs,if you sit there long enough,you'll be sitting in our apartment.
菲比，你若坐得夠久 這裡就會變成我們的公寓

324
00:19:00,670 --> 00:19:02,160
I can't believe this.
我真不敢相信

325
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:06,760
Oh,Rach,FYl: Your new apartment hasn't had hot water since Christmas.
瑞秋，有件事忘了告訴你 你那間新公寓 自聖誕節後就沒熱水了

327
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:13,070
Can you give me a hand?
瑞秋，過來幫我搬這個箱子

328
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:16,810
Put that box down! We are not going anywhere!
不，把箱子放下來 我們哪兒都不去

329
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:20,820
This is my apartment and I like it!
這是我的公寓，我喜歡它

330
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:23,180
This is a girl's apartment!
這是女生的公寓

331
00:19:23,420 --> 00:19:27,760
That is a boy's apartment! It's dirty and it smells!
那裡才是又髒又臭的男生公寓

332
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:30,860
This is pretty! It's so pretty!
這裡漂亮死了…

333
00:19:31,130 --> 00:19:33,360
And look,it's purple!
看，牆壁是紫的

334
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:36,970
I tell you,you with your steady hand,I am not moving.
穩若磐石小姐，我不搬

335
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:40,260
And now I have got the steady hand.
看，我的手也穩若磐石

336
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:45,140
Okay,okay.
好…

337
00:19:47,410 --> 00:19:49,280
-I'll take care of it. -That's right.
我去搞定 這才乖

338
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:51,380
You do what the hand says!
照我手的話去做

339
00:20:03,660 --> 00:20:05,790
-How'd it go? -I lost our mattresses.
情況如何？ 我把床墊輸掉了

341
00:20:11,370 --> 00:20:15,930
Are you in there,little fetus? In nine months will you come greet us?
小胎兒，你在裡面嗎？ 九個月後是否就能夠相見？

343
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:21,010
I will buy you some Adidas
我會幫你買阿迪達斯

344
00:20:28,090 --> 00:20:32,320
We were just at the drugstore so we got you a little present.
我們剛剛去過藥妝店 幫你買了個小禮物

345
00:20:33,090 --> 00:20:35,860
That's where all my blood was.
天啊，腦充血

346
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:39,960
It's a lollipop and a home pregnancy test.
棒棒糖和驗孕棒

347
00:20:41,370 --> 00:20:44,390
Don't mix those up. You could really ruin that lollipop.
別搞混了，棒棒糖沾尿很噁心

349
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:53,140
You feel like taking a test? There's only one question.
想不想驗一下？一次定生死

350
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:57,420
All right. I will.
我驗就是了

351
00:20:57,720 --> 00:21:00,240
Remember that it's still really early.
別忘了，現在還早

352
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:05,390
If it says I'm not pregnant,that doesn't mean I won't get pregnant.
若結果是陰性 不表示我不會懷孕

353
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:08,390
Just so I don't go completely nuts...
拜託你們別寄望太高 

354
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:11,360
...try not to put all your hopes on this.
否則會把我逼瘋的

355
00:21:12,170 --> 00:21:13,762
好

356
00:21:15,670 --> 00:21:16,660
Great.
好極了

357
00:21:25,250 --> 00:21:29,010
You are mean boys who are just being mean!
你們真是壞到骨子裡去了

358
00:21:29,250 --> 00:21:32,480
Don't get mad! No one forced you to raise the stakes.
別把氣出在我們身上 沒人逼你們把公寓拿來賭

359
00:21:32,690 --> 00:21:35,180
That is not true! She forced me!
亂講，她有逼我

360
00:21:35,420 --> 00:21:37,950
You got the question wrong.
答錯的人是你啊

361
00:21:38,190 --> 00:21:40,460
It was a stupid,unfair question!
那個問題太不公平了

362
00:21:40,660 --> 00:21:42,290
Don't blame the questions!
別怪我出的問題

363
00:21:42,500 --> 00:21:46,830
Stop yelling in our apartment! You are ruining moving day for us.
別在我們家大吵大鬧 掃了我們的搬家興

364
00:21:47,070 --> 00:21:49,730
-Stop calling it your apartment! -lt is!
別說這裡是你們家 本來就是

365
00:21:52,370 --> 00:21:56,140
You're going to have a baby. They're going to have a baby!
你們要有寶寶了 他們要有寶寶了

366
00:22:02,580 --> 00:22:05,850
My sister's going to have my baby!
我姐姐要幫我生小孩了

367
00:22:14,490 --> 00:22:17,520
Okay,but this can't be good for the baby.
別抱了，這對寶寶不好

368
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:31,470
I can't find garbage bags.
我找不到垃圾袋

369
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:33,870
I think I saw some in here.
這裡面好像有

370
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,280
What is it?
什麼東西？

371
00:22:40,950 --> 00:22:44,890
I don't know. But maybe if we keep that drawer shut,it'll die.
不知道，要是把抽屜關上 它也許會死

372
